  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There will be no change to the Project Development Objectives/Outcomes (PDO). The PDO is to pilot support to district (kabupaten) governments in improving transparency, accountability and public participatory practices and in undertaking reforms in financial management and procurement.</narrative>
  </description>
